@startuml
title Solver Begins Work on an Assigned Incident

actor Solver
participant "Browser\n(incident page)" as Browser
participant "nginx" as Nginx
participant "Django view\nincident_transition" as View
participant "ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS" as Rules
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Open the incident ==
Solver -> Browser : Click incident from list
Browser -> Nginx : GET /incidents/12/
Nginx -> View : forward request
View -> DB : SELECT incident 12
DB --> View : incident row (status = assigned)
View -> View : _can_access_incident:\nreporter, team member, or lead
View -> DB : SELECT updates for incident 12
DB --> View : timeline rows
View --> Browser : Render page with allowed next actions
Browser --> Solver : Show ticket, timeline,\nand "Move to In Progress" button

== Start work ==
Solver -> Browser : Click "Move to In Progress"
Browser -> Nginx : POST /incidents/12/transition/\nnew_status=in_progress
Nginx -> View : forward request
View -> DB : SELECT incident 12
DB --> View : incident row (status = assigned)
View -> View : Verify solver role and\nteam access again
View -> Rules : is "in_progress" allowed from "assigned"?
Rules --> View : allowed
View -> DB : UPDATE incident\nSET status = in_progress
View -> DB : INSERT IncidentUpdate\n(incident, author, type = status_change,\nold = assigned, new = in_progress, timestamp)
DB --> View : committed
View --> Browser : 302 redirect to /incidents/12/\nwith success message
Browser -> Nginx : GET /incidents/12/
Nginx -> View : forward request
View -> DB : SELECT incident and updates
DB --> View : rows
View --> Browser : Render page
Browser --> Solver : "Ticket #12 moved to In Progress"\ntimeline shows the change\nnext action is "Move to Resolved"

== Rejected transition ==
Solver -> Browser : Attempt "Resolve" from Assigned
Browser -> Nginx : POST /incidents/12/transition/\nnew_status=resolved
Nginx -> View : forward request
View -> Rules : is "resolved" allowed from "assigned"?
Rules --> View : rejected
View --> Browser : 302 redirect with error message
Browser --> Solver : "Cannot move from Assigned\nto Resolved"

note over View, DB
  The timeline row is written only after a transition is
  accepted, so the timeline never shows a refused move.
end note
@enduml
